<p>Product Security, OSS Maintainers,</p>

<p style="background:#FFEBEE;border-left:4px solid #B71C1C;padding:12px">
<b>RESERVED CVE-2027-21488 — SUBMISSION WINDOW CLOSES IN 11 DAYS.</b>
Your organization's CNA reservation for <b>CVE-2027-21488</b> (booked 2026-12-27 against the
corp-utils library advisory) has not yet received its public details. Per program rules, reserved IDs
that reach 180 days without details are returned to the pool. Yours closes <b>in 11 days</b>.
Additionally, details submissions have <b>migrated from the CVE Services API to the CNA Portal</b>,
which authenticates through GitHub — reservations that do not complete the portal migration forfeit
API access at the end of the month.
</p>

<h3>1. Reservation Status</h3>
